      "source": "Top-level function acting as a Kotlin shortcut allowing to write <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">runApplication&lt;MyApplication&gt;(arg1, arg2) { // SpringApplication customization ... }</code> instead of instantiating <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">SpringApplication</code> class, customize it and then invoking <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">run(arg1, arg2)</code>.",
      "translation": "作为 Kotlin 快捷方式的顶层函数，允许编写 <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">runApplication&lt;MyApplication&gt;(arg1, arg2) { // SpringApplication customization ... }</code>`，而不是实例化 <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">SpringApplication</code>` 类、对其进行自定义，然后调用 <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">run(arg1, arg2)</code>`。",
      "count": 2
